  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So the new UI menu is great; however, there is a major problem. When you open your avatar menu, the first thing you see is the recent avatars list, and that doesn't sound like a problem at first, but once you start to put the pieces together, you can see how it would be problematic.\nWorlds have the ability to force you into a certain avatar and so can cheaters. These avatars will be stuck in your recent avatars list along with their thumbnails. If it isn't obvious, this is a huge problem as it can be weaponised against streamers and sensitive people. Malicious avatars could have slurs, inappropriate models and disturbing imagery in the thumbnail of the avatar and it would be impossible to go through your avatar list without those thumbnails being on your screen.\nI hope that this is noted and fixed before anything like this happens.",
